Query: Perform cell-type-specific association testing for each of the 20 CpG sites using the 3 valid aligned datasets: 1) bulk DNA methylation matrix (658 samples, 20 CpGs), 2) cell type composition matrix (7 cell types: CD4., CD8., mono, Bcells, NK, Nue, Eos), 3) disease status trait (binary 0/1). Skip the corrupted covariates matrix as it contains no valid data. For each CpG and each cell type, fit a linear model to estimate the cell-type-specific disease effect, including main effects of cell type and disease, plus their interaction. Extract all results: response (CpG ID), celltype, term (disease-celltype interaction term for cell-type-specific disease effect), coefficient estimate, t-statistic, p-value. Format results into the required dna_methylation_results.txt file with columns: response, celltype, term, estimate, statistic, p.value. Include a header comment in the output file noting that covariate effects are not reported due to the corrupted input covariates file.
